 "Kharos was built to keep time for a city that no longer exists. The city fell and its clocks stopped, but the Hourglass Sentinel still walks its rounds through the empty squares: a bronze giant with a cracked hourglass where its heart should be, the sand inside running upward.\n\nIt fights the way a clock strikes, on the beat and without mercy. Its blade sweeps a half-circle before it like a second hand, and the hero it chooses is held fast while the moment around them stops. Every few seconds it turns the glass, and whatever binds its allies simply runs out.": "Kharos 被造来为一座早已不存在的城市守时。城市陷落，钟表停摆，沙漏哨兵却仍在空荡的广场上巡行：一尊青铜巨像，心脏的位置嵌着一只开裂的沙漏，里面的沙向上流。\n\n它战斗起来如同钟声报时：踩着节拍，毫不留情。它的刀刃像秒针一样在身前扫出半圆，被它选中的英雄会被定在原地，周围的时光随之停止。每隔几秒它便翻转沙漏，束缚它盟友的一切就此流尽。"
